- rule `r1` / reference `p1` / field `$.status` / result path `$.status` = `"complete"`
- rule `r4` / reference `c1` / field `$.conclusion` / result path `$.conclusion` = `"The SI-corrected neutral-singlet 4b optimization is a true minimum and its complete labeled bond/angle/torsion comparison is close to the supplied XRD geometry; this supports the evaluator conclusion within the isolated-molecule model."`
- rule `r4` / reference `c1` / field `$.limitations` / result path `$.limitations[0]` = `"The calculation is an isolated gas-phase molecule while XRD is a crystal measurement."`
- rule `r4` / reference `c1` / field `$.limitations` / result path `$.limitations[1]` = `"The constitutional-isomer correction follows the SI graph and is recorded in route_metadata.json."`
- rule `r4` / reference `c1` / field `$.limitations` / result path `$.limitations[2]` = `"Close-agreement thresholds are audit gates and do not replace the reported per-observable deviations."`

